@startuml
title HSS activation fallout - Rollback

participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue

ROM -> RI : 1 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource (SIM card with Logical SIM)
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 2 **TMF639** 200 OK

ROM -> RI : 3 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource (Number)
RI --> ROM : 4 **TMF639** 200 OK
deactivate RI

@enduml
